From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Heinrich <heip@zhaw.ch>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:00:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: add Fullhan FH8626V200 support for an IPC camera board

Board support for a pan/tilt Wi-Fi camera with the Fullhan FH8626V200
SoC (single Cortex-A7), written against U-Boot 2026.07:

- mach-fh8626 with the SoC timer
- board/fh8626 and a minimal device tree (UART, GPIO, SPI NOR)
- fh8626_defconfig: started by the project's own second-stage loader,
  loads the kernel (zImage with appended DTB) from SPI NOR at 0x80000
  and boots it by default

Signed-off-by: Peter Heinrich <heip@zhaw.ch>
